{"id":878600,"title":"14｜案例解析-工作流类（AI出卷助手）","content":"工作流是智能体的核心，能够实现复杂任务的自动化。以AI出题助手为例，该工具可根据用户上传的题目文件自动生成不同类型的考题，如单选题、多选题等，并允许用户自定义题目类型与数量。通过上传三年级语文、数学和英语的重难点汇总文档，设置难度系数后运行，系统能准确读取文档内容并生成符合要求的题目，包括题目、选项、答案及解析。此外，工作流还支持更复杂的场景，例如撰写论文时自动搜索相关资料、拆分章节并处理上下文引用关系，展示了其在多种应用场景中的灵活性与实用性。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401201,"user_name":"陈广宵","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1131095,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"C76B10CBDCBBE1","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/42/57/3a5d9a4d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1751184222,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145915,"content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps:&#47;&#47;jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn&#47;wiki&#47;Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1751853905,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":401201,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"14节课的文档资料可以提供下做实验吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668207,"discussion_content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps://jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn/wiki/Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","content_length":83,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1751853905,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":401493,"user_name":"菠萝吹雪—Code","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1650378,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"A5B2FC661EE17D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/ava